Subject: [PATCH] Display skyline extent: every pocket of 5 or more towers, in
 any city

The extents now come from one density rule instead of hand-drawn urban
cores for the 38 cities with more than 50 towers: 325 pockets in 128
cities (skyline-extent/skyline-extent.geojson, made by
tools/build_density.py). The map hint, the button tooltip and the Cities
table's Skyline size notes describe the new rule. Applied with
skyline-extent/apply_to_site.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgWWwgjv2K6tfBrnGCoMdE
